      "value": "I can imagine, also for a friends/friends+ world you only need to be logged into the \"insider\" account on the website, and the alternative/burner account on the client and simple as that you can join by clicking the link then you will be sent to said instance with the account that has no friends in that world. Very useful for gangs and people who are out to harass someone on multiple accounts that the victim and their friends has never seen before.\nmeaning the insider account never gets logged and can not be proven to have done anything.\nI've already been a victim of this a lot recently and it makes me feel guilty about hanging about with my friends as I know people will try to come and crash us or ruin whatever fun we're having.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
